QuestGuidance.Register("en",187,{
[5953]="70051394\n1\tTravel to Erebor\tErebor can be found in the north of the Dale-lands. You should travel to Erebor.\n2\tSeek out Mazalu Ugshar\tMazalu Ugshar, The Scholar's Abode can be found in Erebor. You should seek out Mazalu Ugshar.\n3\tTalk to Glóthin\tGlóthin can be found in Erebor. You should talk to Glóthin.\n4\tFind Grár's Key\tMazalu Ugshar can be found in Erebor. You should search The Scholar's Abode for Grár's Key.\n5\tBring Grár's Key to Náin\tNáin can be found in Járnfast. You should return to Náin.\n6\tSeek the entrance of the Howling Pit\tThe entrance to the Howling Pit can be found beyond the last mithril door, deep within Járnfast. You should seek the entrance of the Howling Pit.\n7\tExamine the entrance of the Howling Pit\tThe entrance to the Howling Pit can be found beyond the last mithril door, deep within Járnfast. You should examine the entrance of the Howling Pit.\n8\tTalk to Náin\tNáin can be found next to the Howling Pit. You should talk to Náin.\n",
[5954]="70044282\n1\tPick up the picnic lunch from The Thirsty Seer in the south-west section of the Fifth Circle\tThe Thirsty Seer is in the Fifth Circle of Minas Tirith. The picnic lunch that Pippin ordered should be ready for you to pick up and carry to the Watch-point at the end of the pier on the top of the city.\n2\tTalk to Peregrin Took at the Watch-point at the end of the pier\tPippin is waiting for you at the Watch-point on the end of the pier at the top of Minas Tirith.\n3\tYou are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city.\t\n4\tTalk to Peregrin Took at the Watch-point at the end of the pier\tYou are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city.\n5\tYou are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city. The hobbit became very evasive when recounting the reason for his journey to Minas Tirith with Gandalf.\t\n6\tTalk to Peregrin Took at the Watch-point at the end of the pier\tYou are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city. The hobbit became very evasive when recounting the reason for his journey to Minas Tirith with Gandalf.\n7\tTalk to Peregrin Took once more, despite his reluctance\tYou are sharing a delicious picnic with Pippin at the Watch-point atop the city. He has reluctantly begun to tell you what brought him to Minas Tirith with Gandalf, but he could use some coaxing.\n8\tClean up the picnic at the Watch-point\tYour picnic at the Watch-point is done, and now it is time to clean it up.\n9\tTalk to Peregrin Took at his post in the Citadel\tPippin has returned to his post in the Citadel, the Seventh Circle of the city.\n",
[5955]="700000AC\n1\tMeet Wáli for further Guardian training\tThe dwarf Wáli is at the outpost of Noglond, south of Thorin's Hall and west of the dwarf-city of Gondamon in Ered Luin. You have been told to speak to Wáli, a courageous guardian who may have some words for you.\n2\tTalk to Wáli\tThe dwarf Wáli is at the outpost of Noglond, south of Thorin's Hall and west of the dwarf-city of Gondamon in Ered Luin. You have been told to speak to Wáli, a courageous guardian who may have some words for you.\n",
[5956]="700174D0\n1\tSpeak with Dithrik in the Foundations of Stone\tDithrik can be found in the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You should seek Dithrik if you wish to further your skills as a Guardian, for the trainers of Eriador have little less to show you in this stage of your learning.\n2\tSpeak with Dithrik in the Foundations of Stone\tDithrik can be found in the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You should seek Dithrik if you wish to further your skills as a Guardian, for the trainers of Eriador have little less to show you in this stage of your learning.\n",
[5957]="7003FFD9\n1\tFountain defended (total: 6)\tThe fountains must be preserved.\n",
[5958]="70008245\n1\tPlace canel on flat stones (quantity: see journal)\tThe first pedestal is east of Lin Giliath, and two others are to the south of it in a great curve through the marsh. Medlichen has given you several runes to place on the stone pedestals throughout Meluinen, which he hopes will bring the glade's guardians to its defence.\n2\tTalk to Medlichen\tMedlichen is in Lin Giliath. Medlichen is waiting to hear of your successful placement of the canel upon the stone pedestals throughout Meluinen.\n",
[5959]="70030A86\n1\tDefeat the great spiders of the Silkenhold\tThe Silkenhold can be found in the northern reaches of the Eaves of Fangorn. You should search the Silkenhold for the evil mistresses that have overtaken the trees.\n2\tDefeat Nornbes\030Defeat Faenath\030Defeat Dímil\tThe three mistresses of the Silkenhold can be found throughout that spider-infested stretch of forest. You should defeat the three mistresses of the Silkenhold.\n3\tReturn to the distressed Huorn\tThe distressed Huorn is at the foot of some stony steps leading up into the Silkenhold in northern Fangorn. You should return to the Huorn and tell him that you have defeated the evil mistresses of the Silkenhold, and that there is little to fear now.\n",
[5960]="70041C71\n1\tPatrol Linhir's gates to Dor-en-Ernil\030Patrol Linhir's gates to Lebennin\tLinhir's gates to Dor-en-Ernil can be found in the north-western part of the city and Linhir's gates to Lebennin can be found to the south-west. Erchar has asked you to patrol the gates of Linhir for any sign of the Enemy.\n2\tPatrol the overlook in southern Linhir\tThe overlook can be found in the southernmost part of Linhir. You should patrol the overlook and ensure that the Corsairs at Ethillorn are not rallying a new assault.\n3\tDefeat Corsairs that climbed into Linhir (total: 3)\030Destroy grappling hooks (total: 3)\tCorsairs and their grappling hooks can be found atop the overlook in Linhir. You have discovered Corsairs that scaled the walls of Linhir and should defeat them before throwing down their hooks.\n4\tTalk to Erchar in Linhir\tErchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have completed your patrol and routed a small band of Corsairs that attempted to infiltrate the city. You should now return to Erchar.\n",
[5961]="7003FFBC\n1\tRepair ballistae (total: 2)\tThe ballistae need to be repaired.\n",
[5962]="7002CB05\n1\tDefeat Orcs and spiders in the northern Wailing Hills (total: 10)\tSpiders and Orcs wander among the trees just west of the hidden clearing where Landroval waits. Landroval has asked you to defeat the nearby Orcs and Spiders to allow his meeting location to remain hidden from enemy eyes.\n2\tReturn to the eagle Landroval in his clearing\tLandroval can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of the Wailing Hills. Landroval awaits your return at the hidden clearing.\n",
[5963]="70037BFC\n1\tDefeat waves of enemies assaulting the centre watch-tower ([see journal]/6)\tThe watch-towers upon Helm's Dike grant a favourable position for the Rohirrim. Scouts will mark the numbers of the coming force and fire their arrows upon them as they approach. The enemy will make every effort to take away the advantage the towers provide, you must protect the towers and the archers who fight to defend them.\n",
[5964]="7003A4A5\n1\tDefeat waves of enemies assaulting the two watch-towers ([see journal]/8)\tThe watch-towers upon Helm's Dike grant a favourable position for the Rohirrim. Scouts will mark the numbers of the coming force and fire their arrows upon them as they approach. The enemy will make every effort to take away the advantage the towers provide, you must protect the towers and the archers who fight to defend them. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[5965]="7002D579\n1\tCollect barbed claws and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found in the major hubs of Moria. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
