[5977]="700088B5\n1\tDefeat Orc, Uruk, and troll-guards at Lugazag (total: 10)\tLugazag lies far to the west of Tírith Rhaw. Sergeant-at-Arms Milbrethil instructed you to find and slay guards in the area of Lugazag.\n2\tTalk to Sergeant-at-Arms Mibrethil\tTírith Rhaw is far to the east of Lugazag. Making your way across the Ettenmoors, you found and faced a host of the Ongbúrz defending the tower, Lugazag. You should return to Tírith Rhaw and inform Sergeant-at-Arms Milbrethil of your success against the guards near Lugazag.\n",
[5978]="700544B8\n1\tDefeat armoured sentries (total: 8)\tArmoured sentries can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul. You should defeat any armoured sentries that you find.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many armoured sentries in Minas Morgul.\n",
[5979]="70008771\n1\tDefeat guards at Tírith Rhaw (total: 10)\tTírith Rhaw is a tower in the eastern area of the Ettenmoors. It lay between the central keep of Tol Ascarnen and Ost Ringdyr. Soldier Gazlup ordered you to slaughter the guards keeping watch over Tírith Rhaw.\n2\tSpeak with Soldier Gazlup at Lugazag\tSoldier Gazlup is at Lugazag. You were tasked to kill the guards at Tírith Rhaw by Soldier Gazlup of Lugazag. You should return to Gazlup with news of your victory.\n",
[5980]="70027216\n1\tCollect orders of the White Hand (total: 5)\tWhite Hand orders might be carried by goblins and Warg-riders at Naur-maudhûl, north of Barnavon. Gwilum told you to search for orders on the corpses of the goblins you defeat at Naur-maudhûl.\n2\tBring White Hand orders to Amlan at his camp beneath the eaves of the Gravenwood\tAmlan is at his camp beneath the eaves of the Gravenwood. Gwilum told you to take the White Hand orders to Amlan.\n",
[5981]="70020DAC\n1\tTalk to Gwin Curhonon to escape Khoblún Utot\tGwin Curhonon is at Khoblún Utot in the Gloomglens. Gwin Curhonon has asked you to help him escape the bugan of the Gloomglens.\n2\tTalk to Gwin Curhonon\tGwin Curhonon is hiding outside Khoblún Utot in the Gloomglens. You should speak with Gwin Curhonon about your successful escape from the bugan of Enedwaith.\n",
[5982]="70015E3D\n1\tDefeat Dagronk, Warg-master\tThe leader of the shadow-wargs can be found upon the Burnt Tor, west of Ruidhriel. Ruidhriel has tasked you with slaying the leader of the shadow-wargs.\n2\tTalk to Ruidhriel\tRuidhriel is east of the Burnt Tor. You should return to Ruidhriel and tell her of your success.\n",
[5983]="700174FE\n1\tDefeat toads in the Water-works (total: 8)\030Defeat lizards in the Water-works (total: 8)\tToads and lizards can be found within the Water-works surrounding the Great Wheel. Foreman Indrith believes that the toads and lizards may be clogging the piping of the Water-works.\n2\tTalk to Foreman Indrith in the Wheel-house\tForeman Indrith can be found in the Wheel-house, beneath the Great Wheel. You cleared a good many toads and lizards out from the Water-works surrounding the Great Wheel and should now return to Foreman Indrith to inform him of your work.\n",
[5984]="7005A1D0\n1\tAssist the Gabil'akkâ and break through the icy wall blocking the entrance to Gundabad. You can gain entrance to Gundabad by advancing the Legacy of Durin storyline through 'Chapter 5.2: Breaking Through.'\t\n2\tAdvance the Legacy of Durin storyline through 'Chapter 5.2: Breaking Through' to gain entrance to Gundabad\tAssist the Gabil'akkâ and break through the icy wall blocking the entrance to Gundabad. You can gain entrance to Gundabad by advancing the Legacy of Durin storyline through 'Chapter 5.2: Breaking Through.'\n3\tTalk to Prince Ingór at Maergrind in Gundabad\tPrince Ingór can be found at Maergrind, the The Noble Gate of Máttugard in Gundabad. You have been summoned by Prince Ingór to Gundabad.\n",
